{"unit_id":"GooDAnDReaDY__dsh-time-machine#card-zh","repo":"GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-time-machine","commit":"24e1749f66f14568ad2e6861c0c7b426547792cd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Time Machine（DSH 网页插件）：为 DSH 工作区自动创建检查点，并提供检查点时间线、差异查看和回滚。它接入 DSH 会话事件、工具服务、webServer 与网页侧栏界面，可在回合开始、审批或指定工具执行前保存影子 Git 快照，也可手动创建、列出、清理检查点，查看补丁或统计差异，并恢复整个工作区或单个文件。适合需要追溯 agent 文件改动并恢复工作区的 DSH 用户。需要本地 Git 才能执行基于提交的差异和回滚；插件不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:204-292","lib/index.js:358-507","lib/snapshot.js:117-225","lib/snapshot.js:287-354","lib/snapshot.js:436-485"]}
{"unit_id":"GooDAnDReaDY__dsh-time-machine#card-en","repo":"GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-time-machine","commit":"24e1749f66f14568ad2e6861c0c7b426547792cd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Time Machine is a web plugin for workspace checkpoints, diffs, and rollback. It saves shadow Git snapshots around sessions and selected tool actions, and lets users browse history, compare changes, or restore a workspace or one file. Git is needed for diff and rollback; no API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:204-292","lib/index.js:358-507","lib/snapshot.js:117-225","lib/snapshot.js:287-354","lib/snapshot.js:436-485"]}
